A '''cafe''' was located in [[Nevarro City]] on the [[planet]] [[Nevarro]]. It had an [[Aurebesh]] menu with prices listed in [[Alternative Aurebesh numerals|alternative numerals]]. The dishes included [[Meiloorun fruit|meiloorun]], [[haroun bread]], [[Smoked Kaadu Ribs|kaadu ribs]], [[roast nuna]], [[Galla stew|gala stew]], [[cushnip]] with [[fral]], [[polystarch portion bread|polystarch]], [[veg-meat]], [[Fried Endorian Tip-Yip|Endorian Tip-Yip]], [[shaak kebab]], [[jorgan]] and [[topato]], [[yobshrimp]], and [[roasted sidi]]. When the [[city]] was plundered by [[Gorian Shard's pirate crew|Gorian Shard's pirate gang]], three of the [[pirate]]s harassed a waiter who was working there.<ref name="Pirate" />

